# symiparrot credentials — layer 2 of 3 (env wins; per-project .env loses)
# Providers resolve <ENV_NAME>-style refs through the credentials seam.
# Drop-in pattern: add  KEY_NAME: "value"  — watcher hot-reloads, no restart.
# Empty strings are rejected by the parser; comment keys out instead.
#
# Templates (uncomment + paste when keys arrive):
# EXA_API_KEY: "..."
# PERPLEXITY_API_KEY: "..."
# JAI_API_KEY: "..."
